{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation started (Copilot CLI, worktree impl-c789 off origin/main 5c28ce66).\n\nPlan-review gate: PASS + signed attestation (verified_at_sha 5c28ce66, currency_basis file_impact). Two remediations were applied to the description to clear blocking findings (no design change):\n1. DET readiness floor (P1/P10): promoted `### Acceptance criteria` → exact `## Acceptance Criteria` and added a `## Testing` section naming the proving commands.\n2. E6/F1 (verification honesty): split AC#3 into (a) a CI-provable proxy — the eval spec + committed baseline exist with the correct TP/TN corpus shape and pass the injected-perfect-solve calibration arithmetic (recall 1.0 / false-accept 0.0, tautological by construction) — and (b) an operator-attested billable `rebar criteria eval` AC whose evidence is the frozen baseline JSON. Residual: one minor P6 advisory (AC precision) — non-blocking, acknowledged.\n\nAuthoring-surface note (mechanical correction to the file_impact): this is a PROJECT criterion, so per the actual machinery its files live in the `.rebar/` overlay, not the necessity built-in's packaged paths:\n- rubric → `.rebar/prompts/plan-review-project-failure-disposition-contract.md`\n- eval → `.rebar/evals/plan-review-project-failure-disposition-contract.eval.yaml`\n- committed baseline → `docs/experiments/plan-review-gate/runs/failure_disposition_sanity.json` (mirrors necessity_sanity.json's location)\n- docs → `docs/plan-review-gate.md` only; NOT `docs/plan-review-criteria-guide.md`, which is machine-regenerated from CANONICAL_LLM and would flag a project `## <id>` section as an ORPHAN in `validate_criteria_guide`. Per-criterion documentation is reachable via `rebar explain project.failure-disposition-contract` (rendered from the rubric)."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788144795517639077,"uuid":"1675a835-54a3-4ddc-bda3-c6a3f457dc0f"}